+/**
+ * Hover documentation.
+ *
+ * - Operators, built-in functions and classical B keywords: generated from the official
+ *   documentation (resources hover/eventb.tsv from the Rodin Handbook, hover/classical.tsv from
+ *   ProB's Summary of B Syntax), with a link to the defining section.
+ * - Event-B structure keywords: a short description linking to the Rodin Handbook.
+ * - Identifiers: what they are and their type, from Rodin's type checker (Event-B) or ProB
